depends append
send 1
a store 1,3 +flags.silent \seen
receive 1
a OK done
send 1
b search seen
receive 2
* SEARCH 1 2 3
b OK done
send 1
c store 3,4 +flags.silent notexactlyseen
receive 3
* FLAGS (\Answered \Deleted \Draft \Flagged \Seen notexactlyseen)
* OK [PERMANENTFLAGS (\Answered \Deleted \Draft \Flagged \Seen notexactlyseen \*)] permanent flags
c OK done
send 1
d search seen
receive 2
* SEARCH 1 2 3
d OK done
send 1
e search unseen
receive 2
* SEARCH 4
e OK done
send 1
f store 2 -flags.silent \seen
receive 1
f OK done
send 1
g search seen
receive 2
* SEARCH 1 3
g OK done
send 1
h search unseen
receive 2
* SEARCH 2 4
h OK done
send 3
i1 store 1:* flags.silent ()
i2 store 1,2 +flags.silent (muh)
i3 store 1,3 +flags.silent (feh)
# each new flag makes the server re-announce the mailbox flag list
receive 7
i1 OK done
* FLAGS (\Answered \Deleted \Draft \Flagged \Seen muh notexactlyseen)
* OK [PERMANENTFLAGS (\Answered \Deleted \Draft \Flagged \Seen muh notexactlyseen \*)] permanent flags
i2 OK done
* FLAGS (\Answered \Deleted \Draft \Flagged \Seen feh muh notexactlyseen)
* OK [PERMANENTFLAGS (\Answered \Deleted \Draft \Flagged \Seen feh muh notexactlyseen \*)] permanent flags
i3 OK done
send 4
j1 search keyword muh keyword feh
j2 search keyword muh unkeyword feh
j3 search unkeyword muh keyword feh
j4 search unkeyword muh unkeyword feh
receive 8
* SEARCH 1
j1 OK done
* SEARCH 2
j2 OK done
* SEARCH 3
j3 OK done
* SEARCH 4
j4 OK done
send 2
k1 search or keyword muh keyword feh
k2 search or unkeyword muh unkeyword feh
receive 4
* SEARCH 1 2 3
k1 OK done
* SEARCH 2 3 4
k2 OK done
send 1
l fetch 1:* flags
receive 5
* 1 FETCH (FLAGS (\Recent feh muh))
* 2 FETCH (FLAGS (\Recent muh))
* 3 FETCH (FLAGS (\Recent feh))
* 4 FETCH (FLAGS (\Recent))
l OK done
end
